<title>USA: CBL &amp; Associates Q1 net shr $0.38 vs $0.32.</title>
<headline>CBL &amp; Associates Q1 net shr $0.38 vs $0.32.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.38		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net		 8,980		    6,737</p>
<p> Revs		41,242		   35,380</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary23,784		   20,847</p>
<p>Avg shrs</p>
<p>    converted    33,192		   30,221</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company reported funds from operations of $0.53 a share, compared with $0.50 for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>The company reported total funds from operations for the quarter of $17.385 million versus $15.149 million.</p>
<p>The company reported funds from operations applicable to REIT shareholders of $12.4 million compared with $10.45 million.</p>
